BT /F1 18 Tf 50 720 Td (Deep Learning for Medical Diagnosis: An Empirical Study) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 50 690 Td (Authors: Dr. Alex Turner, Dr. Sarah Lin - Department of AI & CS) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 50 650 Td (Abstract) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 630 Td (Automated medical image classification has made notable breakthroughs using convolutional architectures.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 615 Td (In this paper, we introduce MedVisionNet, a novel lightweight convolutional neural network) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 600 Td (engineered specifically to detect diabetic retinopathy from retinal fundus photographs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 585 Td (Experimental evaluations show MedVisionNet achieves an accuracy of 94.8 percent on the test benchmark.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 50 550 Td (1. Introduction and Problem Statement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 530 Td (Early diagnosis of retinal diseases prevents irreversible vision impairment in diabetes patients.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 515 Td (Traditional manual clinical screening is labor-intensive, costly, and prone to diagnostic delays.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 500 Td (Our main contribution is an optimized residual feature extractor tailored for high-resolution retinal images.) Tj ET

endstream
