BT /F1 14 Tf 50 720 Td (2. Methodology: MedVisionNet Architecture) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 700 Td (MedVisionNet utilizes a 24-layer depthwise separable convolutional backbone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 685 Td (We integrate Spatial Attention Modules to isolate vascular lesions and microaneurysms.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 670 Td (Optimization: AdamW optimizer was utilized with a cosine annealing learning rate scheduler.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 655 Td (Initial learning rate: 0.0003, Batch size: 32, Weight decay: 0.01.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 50 615 Td (3. Experimental Results) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 595 Td (The model was trained and evaluated on the EyePACS and Messidor-2 benchmark datasets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 580 Td (Performance metrics achieved: Accuracy: 94.8 percent, Precision: 93.2 percent, Recall: 95.1 percent, F1-Score: 94.1 percent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 565 Td (MedVisionNet requires only 4.2 million parameters, a 70 percent reduction compared to ResNet-50.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 50 525 Td (4. Limitations and Future Work) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 505 Td (Limitations: The dataset primarily contains images from adult cohorts; pediatric data was not evaluated.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 490 Td (Additionally, performance degrades under extreme optical motion blur.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 475 Td (Future work will incorporate multimodal patient demographic records and self-supervised pretraining.) Tj ET

endstream
